---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import myPhoto from "../assets/poto.png"
---

<section class="animate">
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.12]">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-black dark:text-white">About Me</h2>
      <div class="relative size-11 rounded-full overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-black/15 dark:ring-white/20 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out">
        <Image
          src={myPhoto}
          alt="Anggun Caksono"
          width={44}
          height={44}
          class="rounded-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-3.5 text-black/80 dark:text-white/80">
      <p>
        I am an Informatics Engineering student, full-stack software developer, and Google Cloud Arcade Fasilitator based in Indonesia. As a Cloud Computing alumnus of Bangkit Academy 2024 (led by Google, GoTo, and Traveloka), I completed the Entrepreneur Track and received incubation funding for MIRA, a radiology PACS technology initiative deployed on GCP.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a Google Cloud Arcade Fasilitator, I help participants work through hands-on GCP labs, troubleshooting environment challenges, guiding console navigation, and supporting them across compute, storage, networking, and machine learning tracks.
      </p>
      <p>
        My core focus spans full-stack web engineering (Astro, TypeScript, Node.js, Go), cloud infrastructure setup (GCP, AWS, Firebase), and machine learning applications (TensorFlow, Scikit-learn via IDCamp 2024 ML Track).
      </p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white pt-1">
        Currently available for full-stack engineering, cloud architecture, and freelance project opportunities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
